                <pb facs="0657" n="647" sameAs="frus:frus1864p1/pg647"/>

                <head ana="#head_untitled-missing-head-in-printed-volume">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">London</hi>,</placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1864-04-08"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >April</hi> 8, 1864.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>We agree, all of us that sign this agreement, firemen and sailors, steward and
                    cook, to go to Calais to work on board the American steamship Rappahannock, <pb
                        facs="0658" n="648" xml:id="pg648"/> to have 4<hi rendition="#italic"
                    >s</hi>. per day, cook and steward the same; sailors to have 3<hi
                        rendition="#italic">s</hi>. per day and all to have victual and passage
                    money, to be paid by John Seymour. All of them to work for seven days.</p>
